CCS Concepts: · Computing methodologies; · Image processing;
Additional Key Words and Phrases: image-to-image translation, sketch-based image synthesis, hair image synthesis

- A novel system for non-professional users to create photorealistic hair images with various hair geometry, structure, and appearance from freehand sketches;
- A two-stage framework for first generating hair mattes from sketches and then synthesizing hair images from sketches and generated mattes;
- An intuitive sketch-based interface for hairstyle design, with two novel hair sketch auto-completion features;
- A new dataset containing 4,500 hair sketch-image pairs, with the corresponding hair mattes.
